icativas ou que desempenharam papéis históricos significativos no desenvolvimento cultural ou social local; pode ou não ser oficialmente designado. Para edifícios abandonados, mas não considerados necessariamente históricos, use "edifícios abandonados".</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="en">Buildings that are significant in the history of architecture, that incorporate significant architectural features, or that played significant historic roles in local cultural or social development; may or may not be officially designated. For buildings that are abandoned but not considered necessarily historic, use "abandoned buildings."</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="es">Edificio que es significativo desde el punto de vista de la historia de la arquitectura, que incorpora características arquitectónicas importantes o que juega un papel histórico relevante en el desarrollo local cultural o social. Puede o no estar diseñado oficialmente.</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="nl">Wordt gebruikt voor gebouwen die van belang zijn in de geschiedenis van de architectuur, die belangrijke architectonische elementen bevatten of die een belangrijke historische rol hebben gespeeld in de plaatselijke culturele of sociale ontwikkeling; kan al of niet officieel zijn aangewezen.</skos:note><skos:broader rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300004790"/></skos:Concept><ore:Aggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/254/EA_set4_00090"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/254/EA_set4_00090"/><edm:dataProvider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000047036021"></edm:dataProvider><edm:isShownAt rdf:resource="http://ea-and.civitat.com/?id=EA-AND-00090"/><edm:isShownBy rdf:resource="http://ea-and.civitat.com/EA-AND/images/zyuGJY_1.Postanska6.JPG"/><edm:object rdf:resource="http://ea-and.civitat.com/EA-AND/images/zyuGJY_1.Postanska6.JPG"/><edm:provider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000004671084"></edm:provider><edm:rights rdf:resource="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/"/><edm:intermediateProvider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000023939475"></edm:intermediateProvider></ore:Aggregation><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/provider/254/EA_set4_00090"><dc:creator xml:lang="en">unknown</dc:creator><dc:creator xml:lang="en">Valentina Vuković (photographer)</dc:creator><dc:date>Beginning of 20th centrury</dc:date><dc:description xml:lang="en">The high single-storey building with its vertical and asymmetrical picturesque façade, filled with flat stylized decoration, represents a clear example of secession style which in this part of Vojvodina is a rarity.</dc:description><dc:language xml:lang="en">English</dc:language><dc:subject rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300008063"></dc:subject><dc:title xml:lang="en">Residential building, Poštanska 6, Sremski Karlovci</dc:title><dc:type xml:lang="en">image</dc:type><dcterms:isPartOf xml:lang="en">Europeana Archaeology</dcterms:isPartOf><dcterms:spatial>EA-set4-00090#place</dcterms:spatial><dcterms:temporal>EA-set4-00090#time</dcterms:temporal><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/254/EA_set4_00090"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/254/EA_set4_00090"/><edm:type>IMAGE</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/europeana/254/EA_set4_00090"><dc:date xml:lang="en">Beginning of 20th centrury</dc:date><dc:identifier>EA-set4-00090</dc:identifier><dc:language>eng</dc:language><dcterms:spatial xml:lang="en">EA-set4-00090#place</dcterms:spatial><dcterms:temporal xml:lang="sl">EA-set4-00090#time</dcterms:temporal><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/254/EA_set4_00090"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/254/EA_set4_00090"/><ore:lineage